WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.140
Speaker 1: I want to briefly talk about Ivanka&nbsp;
Trump. Many of you emailed me about this story.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:09.960
Ivanka Trump is refusing to be involved with&nbsp;
Donald Trump's 2024 run. Now she is putting a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:14.760
very positive spin on it there. There's&nbsp;
an article in the cut which summarizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:20.760
this called Ivanka would prefer not to. The&nbsp;
article is by Clare Lampe and it was published&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:26.700
yesterday and it includes a transcript of&nbsp;
Ivanka's Instagram post where she said,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:33.780
I love my father very much. This time around,&nbsp;
I'm choosing to prioritize my young children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:39.120
and the private life we are creating together&nbsp;
as a family. I do not plan to be involved in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:44.520
politics. While I will always love and support&nbsp;
my father going forward, I will do so outside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:48.780
the political arena. I am grateful to have&nbsp;
had the honor of serving the American people,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:53.400
and I will always be proud of many of&nbsp;
our administration's accomplishments.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.940 --> 00:01:03.120
Listen, this has been a building fiasco for&nbsp;
Jared and Ivanka. And I have to say, you know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:09.840
this isn't about I think Ivanka is great, but it&nbsp;
has always struck me that from the adult children&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:17.640
and I include Jared Kushner in this as the son&nbsp;
in law that Ivanka most accurately had the pulse&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:29.160
had a understood the pulse of what the perception&nbsp;
of Trump and his kids was. And we had numerous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.160 --> 00:01:35.760
reports when Trump's term was waning and it was,&nbsp;
you know, he had lost already. He was claiming he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:39.600
was going to figure out a way to stay, but it was&nbsp;
obvious he was leaving. There were these reports&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:48.060
about how Jared and Ivana were struggling with the&nbsp;
fact that their old social circles were refusing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:52.800
They were they were not welcoming them back in.&nbsp;
And there were a bunch of different stories that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:57.720
you can find about this. And then in the lead up&nbsp;
to Donald Trump's announcement on Tuesday night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:04.080
there was also reporting about Trump has been&nbsp;
begging Jared and Ivana to be there and it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:08.520
not clear whether they are going to be there. And&nbsp;
at the end of the day, if Ivanka wasn't there and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:16.260
Jared Kushner was, I actually respect this more&nbsp;
than anything I've ever seen Ivanka do. Of course,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.260 --> 00:02:19.680
she was in way over her head, even being involved&nbsp;
with this administration. She had no business&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:24.900
there. Remember when she sat in for then Secretary&nbsp;
of State Rex Tillerson at like the G something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:33.720
summit? It's all completely and utterly insane.&nbsp;
But the most responsible and respectful thing that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:40.980
Ivanka. Has done here is to recognize this was a&nbsp;
humiliation. And, hey, you know what? She values&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:47.700
her personal life. She values her social life. She&nbsp;
realizes that it was humiliating. What happened?&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:52.860
I am sure that she still thinks that good things&nbsp;
were done by her dad. I don't I don't think she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:57.720
thinks it was a disaster. But she increasingly&nbsp;
recognizes the cartoonish nature of what went on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:02.340
around the January six riots. There are reports&nbsp;
that Ivanka was horrified by what was going on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:08.400
and wasn't thrilled with Donald Trump's response.&nbsp;
So I understand why she's not just coming out and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:12.900
saying this was a complete humiliation to my&nbsp;
my personal family. Right. Her and her kids.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:18.240
There is probably all sorts of crazy stuff&nbsp;
going on in terms of her versus Jared,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:22.260
because for now it seems that Jared is standing&nbsp;
behind Trump, although it increasingly seems&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:27.120
like he's not. He would not be a part of in an&nbsp;
upcoming Trump administration. This actually is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:32.880
the most logical thing I've ever heard of Ivanka&nbsp;
doing. She should have no involvement. It's been a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:38.760
humiliation. It's been bad for her. It's obviously&nbsp;
terrible for her kids. And this is clearly the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:44.640
right decision. So good for Ivanka. I think it&nbsp;
makes sense. And the question now remains, what's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:50.220
Jared going to do on a personal level? I don't&nbsp;
care. But it is interesting to see the difference&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:57.480
between Eric and Don Jr, who are clearly full&nbsp;
speed ahead on this, and Ivanka, who seems a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:02.100
little bit more reflective and thoughtful about&nbsp;
the disaster that this has been for their family.

